  m_Name: Week4_Mission4_Dialogue_3 V2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Cub
  speechLines:
  - Oh, hello, detective. I don't think I want to.
  - Consider this a solid from helping me with my phone a few weeks ago.
  - I gave your data to my bosses back then, but I also used it to call my family.
  - They led me to retire my criminal acts, surrender, and start anew.
  - Thank you detective for my second life.
